⍝ ==== s2 driver: s2c file.trh --tokens | --ast prints what trithc prints

⍝ ‹streq2› a b: the strings are equal
⦃
  ⧖:a,b
  ⧗:a,b ○ ⦶
  ⍝ the loop carries [a b i acc]
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:a,b,i,acc
    ⧗:a,i ᛒ ⧖:x
    ⧗:a,b ⧗:i △ ⊞ ⧗:acc ⧗:x ⧗:b,i ᛒ ᛖ ⋎
    ⧗:x #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⁼
  ⦄
  ⧖:a,b,i,acc ⧗:acc
⦄ ⟨⟗ʃ ⟗ʃ ⊸ ŧ⟩ ‹streq2› ⸫

⦃ ⧖:a,b ⧗:b ⟗ ⧗:a ‹streq2› ⧖:r ⌁̵ ⧗:r ⦄ ⟨⟗ʃ ʃ ⊸ ŧ⟩ ‹streqo› ⸫

⍝ ‹modeof› arg: 1 for --tokens, 2 for --ast, 3 for --check, else 0
⦃
  ⟗ $--tokens$ ‹streqo› ⧖:r1 ⟗ $--ast$ ‹streqo› ⧖:r2 ⟗ $--check$ ‹streqo› ⧖:r3 ⌁̵
  ○ ⧗:r3 ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #3# ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⧗:r2 ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #2# ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⧗:r1 ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ △ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
⦄ ⟨ʃ ⊸ ℤ⟩ ‹modeof› ⸫

⦃
  ⧖:path,out,count,rem
  ⧗:path ⎙̵ $: error: imbalance: $ ⎙̵ ⧗:count ᛁ $ tokens, $ ⎙̵ ⧗:rem ᛁ $ too many for the Ternary Balance Law\n$ ⎙̵
  ⧗:out ⌁̵ △ ‹exit›
⦄ ⟨ʃ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹imbal› ⸫

⦃ ⧖:T,st ⧗:st ⟗ ⧗:T ‹adump› ⌁̵ ⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟦ℤ⟧ ⊸⟩ ‹dumpw› ⸫

⍝ ‹astw› path toks: parse, tangle and print the item tree
⦃
  ⧖:path,toks
  ⧗:toks ‹tindex› ‹ok› ⟗ ⧗:path ‹parse› ⧖:st ⟗ ⧗:st ‹dumpw› ⌁̵
⦄ ⟨⟗ʃ ⟦ℤ⟧ ⊸ ◌⟩ ‹astw› ⸫

⍝ ‹checkw› path toks: parse, tangle and check (printing the trace), then "ok"
⦃
  ⧖:path,toks
  ⧗:toks ‹tindex› ‹ok› ⟗ ⧗:path ‹parse› ⧖:st ⟗ ⧗:path,st △ ‹cinit› ‹check› ⌁̵ $ok\n$ ⎙̵ ⌁̵
⦄ ⟨⟗ʃ ⟦ℤ⟧ ⊸ ◌⟩ ‹checkw› ⸫

⦃
  ⧖:path,out,mode
  ⧗:path,out,mode ⍿⁰ △ ᛖ
  ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⧖:o ⧗:o ⟗ ‹dump› ⌁̵ ⌁̵ ⦄
    ⦃ #2# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⧖:o ⟗ ⧗:o ‹astw› ⁇ ⦃ ⌁̵ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁̵ △ ‹exit› ⦄ ⦄
      ⦃ ⧖:o ⟗ ⧗:o ‹checkw› ⁇ ⦃ ⌁̵ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁̵ △ ‹exit› ⦄ ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨ʃ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹run› ⸫

⦃
  ⧖:path,mode,out
  ⧗:out ⟗ ○ ᚳ ⧖:count ⧖:out
  ⧗:count #3# ⊜ ⁇ ⦃ ⦄ ⦃ ○ ⦄ ⍿⁰ ○ ≶ ⋔ ∅ ∅ ⦃ #3# ⊞ ⦄ ⧖:rem
  ⧗:path,out,count,rem,mode
  ⧗:rem ○ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⧖:m ⌁ ⌁ ⧗:m ‹run› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ‹imbal› ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨ʃ ℤ ⟦ℤ⟧ ⊸⟩ ‹main3› ⸫

⦃
  ⧖:path,mode,src
  ⧗:src ⟗ ᛞ ⧖:cps ⌁̵
  ⧗:path ⟗ ⧗:cps ‹lexw› ⧗:mode ⍿¹ ⁇ ⦃ ‹main3› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁̵ △ ‹exit› ⦄
⦄ ⟨ʃ ℤ ʃ ⊸⟩ ‹main2› ⸫

⦃
  ⧖:path,mode
  ⧗:path ⟗ ᚠ ⧗:mode ⍿¹ ⁇
    ⦃ ⟗ ⍴̱ ○ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁̵ ⌁ ⎙̵ $: error: cannot read file (or file is empty)\n$ ⎙̵ △ ‹exit› ⦄ ⦃ ‹main2› ⦄ ⁼ ⦄
    ⦃ ⌁ ⎙̵ $: error: cannot read file (or file is empty)\n$ ⎙̵ △ ‹exit› ⦄
⦄ ⟨ʃ ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹main1› ⸫

⦃ $usage: s2c <file.trh> --tokens | --ast | --check\n$ ⎙̵ #2# ‹exit› ⦄ ⟨⊸⟩ ‹usage› ⸫

⦃
  △ ᚨ ⁇
    ⦃ #2# ᚨ ⁇
        ⦃ ‹modeof› ⍿⁰ ○ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁̵ ‹usage› ⦄ ⦃ ‹main1› ⦄ ⁼ ⦄
        ⦃ ⌁̵ ‹usage› ⦄ ⦄
    ⦃ ‹usage› ⦄
⦄ ⟨⊸⟩ ᛟ ⸫
